## Virkar það á íslensku?

Icelandic support in technology has improved considerably in recent years. Through focused work and advocacy, Icelandic has made its way into many of the solutions that matter most in the daily lives of people and businesses, and it generally holds up reasonably well across the major platforms.

The table below summarizes how well Icelandic works in solutions from the largest technology companies, rating each on a scale of 1 to 5 based on how usable it is in Icelandic.

{% ratings /%}

## Samstarf við OpenAI

The clearest example of what focused advocacy can achieve is the partnership between Iceland and OpenAI. After the first language technology delegation in 2022, a direct dialogue opened with the company, leading to a partnership that drew international attention to Iceland's approach.

Icelandic became the first language other than English to be integrated into ChatGPT-4 in a targeted way.

The Icelandic company **Miðeind** played a key role, working with OpenAI to provide training data and feedback on the model's quality, including general evaluation of how well it understood and produced Icelandic.

